            <div xml:id="d716">

                <pb facs="0991" n="977" sameAs="frus:frus1944v06/pg977"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.24/1723: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Gauss</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-06-12T21:00:00-04:00">June 12, 1944—9
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>820. With State Department approval FEA has requested Fowler and Joyner to
                    present letter embodying restatement of lend-lease policy in accordance with
                    your cable 977, June 5.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
